This connects directly with the macro architecture pipeline established earlier:

```
Requirements ➔ Architecture Drivers ➔ Architecture Analysis ➔ Architecture Selection ➔ HLD ➔ Major Components ➔ System Design ➔ Communication / Data Flow ➔ LLD
```

Then, within the **Presentation** component, you make the explicit MVVM architectural decision:

